# S1: the AUDITED smoke of the traced carry copies: c2-packed-tp4-best-gate-tpub, the combined best with every verify audit, the fused-commit audit and the singles audit on, plus
# QWEN_FAST_TP4_TRACED_PUBLISH=1 and QWEN_FAST_TP4_TRACED_PUBLISH_AUDIT=1. After every traced carry save or restore the eager loop runs over the same destination and the two results are read back
# and compared bit for bit on every chip. The lone-user (sequential) steps are in warmup, coding and long_real_text; steady_resend runs one more after the four-user mix.
# Read: one '[TPUB] carry traces engaged' line a request engine and NO '[TPUB] carry traces declined' line; '[TPUB-AUDIT] op=save checked=960 mismatches=0' on every line (and op=restore
# lines when an engine switch happened; 960 = 48 layers x 5 tensors x 4 chips); the packed lines unchanged from c2-packed-tp4-best-gate ('[PACKED-FUSED-AUDIT] ... mismatches=0', the quad audits equal);
# c2_smoke_check clean (it enforces all of this); the texts equal the best-gate smoke's. STOP on any mismatch or decline.
# Duration (estimate): reset 1 to 3 min, build 10 to 30 min, the smoke 30 to 60 min: 100 min at most.
# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the four-card tp4/tpub window (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it):
# copy it over .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/tpub and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here
# names a rig, a card, a host or a registry: the cards are resolved at run time. The jobs are templates only: no tag is pushed from this branch.
# ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG names the image a build-only job (C2_ACTIONS=build, no card opened) builds from this branch while
# production serves; a later commit of scripts needs a new build and tag. C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-tpub-1 is a PLACEHOLDER the driver may substitute.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset smoke
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-tpub-1
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-best-gate-tpub
C2_SMOKE_TESTS=warmup,coding,long_real_text,concurrent4,concurrent4_steady,steady_resend,concurrent4_code_equal
